"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE FIVE LEGITIMATE USES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Reimbursement | Research | Public Health</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Quality Measurement | Resource Allocation</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Coding never replaces clinical judgment</text></svg>",
